QuickTicket Alembic migration chain, Lab 12.

The database objects already exist from app/seed.sql. Stamp the baseline revision
(c12a00000001) ONLY after checking the current database schema. Then upgrade
one revision at a time with the separate deployments between migrations.

Do not use `alembic upgrade head` before Deploy A and Deploy B: doing so
would remove `event_date` while old events application pods still query it.

See LAB12_WINDOWS_KALI_GUIDE.md and submissions/lab12.md.
